model inside AI Studio after `ensure_model()`.\n    2. Actual Thinking Level after `ensure_thinking_mode()`.\n    3. Whether fresh chat/session was created per batch (`CLEAR_CHAT_ON_REQUEST=true`).\n    4. Total length of final prompt into AI Studio.\n    5. Raw final response from AI Studio.\n    6. `Valid JSON: True/False`.\n    7. Schema compliance check (`results` array with `case_id`, `status`, `item_id`).\n    8. Count of cases sent vs results returned.\n  - Directly test the 5 core business rules:\n    - Strength conflict $\\rightarrow$ `NO_MATCH` (Red line)\n    - Dosage form conflict with same product & strength $\\rightarrow$ `REVIEW`\n    - Pack size difference only $\\rightarrow$ `MATCH`\n    - OCR corruption in name (same commercial identity) $\\rightarrow$ `MATCH`\n    - Generic/Alternative brand $\\rightarrow$ `NO_MATCH`\n\n---\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Completed:\n1. **Business Rules & Decision Graph Overhaul**:\n   - `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy\\review\\project_spec.md`: Fully aligned Section 4 with the new rules.\n   - `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy\\review\\match_guards.py`: Rewritten to separate strength units (`STRENGTH_KINDS = {\"mass_mg\", \"volume_ml\", \"percent\"}`) from pack counts/sizes (`tablets`, `capsules`, `strips`, `sachets`, `bare_numbers`). Explicit strength conflict $\\rightarrow$ `NO_MATCH`. Form conflict $\\rightarrow$ `REVIEW`. Pack size does NOT prevent `MATCH`.\n   - `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy\\review\\probe_gemini_match.py`: System prompt and 10 control cases aligned.\n   - `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy\\review\\build_orders.py` & `local_provider.py` & `orders.config.local.json`: Added full support for `\"provider\": \"msemax\"` / `\"local\"` to run reviews against the local AI Studio gateway.\n2. **MSEMAX-GAIStudio Gateway Fixes (`D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio\\app.py` & `.env`)**:\n   - `format_messages_to_prompt()`: Removed the `len(messages) <= 2` bug. `[System Instructions]` is now **never dropped**, preserving JSON schema & r